  "title": "Grilled Buffalo Cauliflower in Foil",
  "description": "Buffalo grilled cauliflower is easy to cook on your grill with Buffalo wing sauce, ranch dressing mix, olive oil, and aluminum foil; cleanup is a breeze!",
